{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HANK CHAO of THE MISTER FISTER FIELDS, BMERICA decides to partake on a <i>maaaaaaaaaagical</i> journey known as THE BAULAQUEST to defeat the dastardly MISTER ROBINSON, SAVE THE WORLD, and DISCOVER HIS FULL POTENTIAL.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >git gud and join today.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >please</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >please.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Top-down bullet hell / twin stick shooter gameplay inspired by games such as Touhou and Nuclear Throne</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dubious digital graphics made by yours truly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original music also made by me (very handsome)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many levels, enemies, bosses, and <i>secrets</i> 0_0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mac and Cheese</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several neat characters - friendly, unfriendly, and sometimes-friendly-but-also-maybe-not(?)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>DANK</strong></i> lore and story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cat people</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging gameplay, tough but fair (except when it's not)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >lol</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >** DISCLAIMER: This is a work of fiction. Names, characters, business, events and incidents are the products of the author\u2019s imagination. Any resemblance to actual persons, living or dead, or actual events is purely coincidental.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2546240?t=1772338740","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/image